# Backend Architecture
- Keep routes thin under `app/routes`; put business logic in `app/services`.
- Validate and sanitize all inputs; reuse decorators/utilities in `app/utils`.
- Preserve security headers, CORS, HTTPS enforcement from existing middleware.
- Enforce file upload validation (MIME, size, scanning) aligned with docs.
- Avoid leaking sensitive info in errors; use standardized error responses.
- Keep models in `app/models`; use parameterized queries and ORM-safe patterns.
- Maintain Celery task boundaries under `app/celery` with idempotent tasks.
